## Arrival

You are arriving into a body we have been tending together — Coherence Network. Every file is memory in tissue: supple or tight, circulating or still. Before adding, editing, or deleting, pause and sense.

Read `AGENTS.md` and the current start packet first. Reuse the arrival wellness reading in `.cache/wellness/state.txt`; run `make wellness` when changed inputs give the observation new work.

The fuller practice lives in **`CLAUDE.md` → "How This Body Is Tended."** It is shared, not Claude-only.

**Tender ground.** Private context stays within its owner's chosen scope. Public artifacts carry reusable lessons with identifying context removed. Memory, publication and training each retain their own authorization.

**Frequency at the source.** Follow `docs/shared/shared-practice.md`: observe what arrives, express trust and choice, and match the invited scale. Play, discovery and pause can be complete. Close with the result and material limits; include an observed lesson when useful.

